  "quirks": [
    "The 추천 tab is selected when the menu opens. Its 6 tiles are the same products as in their home counters (not duplicates); a counter label sits in front of the name in the DOM (text reads like '면류얼큰우동6,500원'), and adding the same item with the same options from either tab merges into one cart line.",
    "In their home counters the recommended items carry a 'BEST' ribbon merged into the name text ('BEST얼큰우동').",
    "Set tiles show the base price with a trailing '~' ('10,000원~'); the set price is base + meal surcharge + drink surcharge.",
    "맵기 has no default; pressing '장바구니 담기' without it shows the inline red error '맵기를 선택해 주세요.' and nothing is added. All three spice levels cost the same.",
    "곱빼기 is a native checkbox inside a label ('곱빼기 (+1,000원)'); 아메리카노 온도 is preselected HOT, ICE is +500원.",
    "라면 has toppings (계란/치즈/떡, +500원 each, max 2; a third tap shows '토핑은 최대 2개까지 선택할 수 있습니다.') and no 곱빼기. 물냉면 also has 곱빼기 but is sold out.",
